From 36d507042e219500cc61fbf66fe2f74adf7ad053 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 04:25:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] grab: detect a phone pulled out of a hand in use, lock it and
 tell the owner

Squash of former patches:

- 0001 grab: decide whether the phone was pulled out of a hand in use
- 0002 grab: settings keys of the grab detection (mode, thresholds, triggered flag)
- 0003 grab: lock the phone and arm the restart timer when it is pulled out of a hand in use
- 0004 grab: tell the owner above the PIN entry why the phone locked and when it restarts
- 0005 grab: a new touch voids the release before it, and report a peak without touch
- 0006 grab: keep exceptions off the handler thread, log untouched peaks, cancel the timer if the keyguard does not show
- 0007 grab: @hide tags on their own line, one message text for every credential type
- 0008 grab: pass the settings to BouncerMessageInteractor in the SystemUI test fixture
